      }
    ],
    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 5,
        "sourceEnd": 42,
        "text": "Hi, Ben. You look worried. What's up?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "1d8768ec3c57be16d579ff9493d1e5c2d12499c20546e8ce4203f1c26e046304",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 48,
        "sourceEnd": 146,
        "text": "Oh, hi Mia. It's my new smart speaker. I think it's great, but my sister says it's a privacy risk.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "1ca381f553b0b05cb9b98c6e5c163cd1e34a71b9fc1e63db1039ec1084743d4e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 152,
        "sourceEnd": 178,
        "text": "Really? What does she say?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "104b3d53f5a7000fa79097f63198c58b277c0fff13bfbadc385e3c6a619ac397",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 184,
        "sourceEnd": 276,
        "text": "She says that the speaker is always listening. She thinks that it records everything we say.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "0e492a2d90b90389804446ecfd330c9fb8e5945919f1b92acc0064315609e783",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 282,
        "sourceEnd": 412,
        "text": "Well, that's not exactly true. Most smart speakers only start recording after they hear a wake word, like \"Alexa\" or \"Hey Google\".",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "3a08bb769916bf6204b3b627afb6865d725ddefbdbf5e136b7dd3718a31ef9d4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 418,
        "sourceEnd": 496,
        "text": "That's what I thought. But my sister insists that the microphone is always on.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "f913a2d26108f5055e834f452fd85838b19a5c9eb3aff94503c73580e179bed7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 502,
        "sourceEnd": 623,
        "text": "The microphone is on, yes, but it doesn't send data until it hears the wake word. At least, that's what the company says.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "3f83ecaea80866cf29e31aca250adeec74f1941a17d1fc6bc29ab1d23343ab68",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 629,
        "sourceEnd": 704,
        "text": "Hmm. But what if the speaker makes a mistake and records something private?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "c290b5c5c1cbaf40858e0f63558531008ea063e339ff6280174510270c853214",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 710,
        "sourceEnd": 800,
        "text": "That can happen, but it's rare. You can check your privacy settings and delete recordings.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "54ce0b9d61edc42361e1af95ffcd22cf346656f3313a2b50f557129660ec1c34",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 806,
        "sourceEnd": 843,
        "text": "I didn't know that. How do I do that?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "c227c9eac7723524f7eee13d8b24746780e61a56da2704c530a21c69a55008ff",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 849,
        "sourceEnd": 963,
        "text": "You can use the app. If you go to the settings menu, you'll see an option to review and delete your voice history.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "96c2edeb4e8db39c940e0036a590fdc659e6a9375e0bb2535f6077a5e08c5db8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 969,
        "sourceEnd": 1045,
        "text": "OK, I'll try that. But my sister also says that the speaker could be hacked.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "e4c9b6797ec99b30e7cd12bd8a9a4b5bfbcc02e798f472257152fd84c76f28ea",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1051,
        "sourceEnd": 1208,
        "text": "Any device connected to the internet can be hacked, but you can reduce the risk. For example, you should use a strong password and keep the software updated.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "effd3fdc5936c0f6ed27909871c8f391f82b66f30f50b7954fe002fecf0161bc",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1214,
        "sourceEnd": 1298,
        "text": "That makes sense. I'll update it tonight. But what about the data? Where does it go?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "911c894023ad70c65ccf2c4d0216532827a99cc51e235fb061a3072c4bc38d29",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1304,
        "sourceEnd": 1419,
        "text": "The company stores some data on its servers to improve the service. You can choose not to share some types of data.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "1b517b6f80749107dc1fc0a6928e9178284e100bf6653191f82fba0e464cf107",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1425,
        "sourceEnd": 1460,
        "text": "So I can control what they collect?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "7d1fa38ed97eb691a339b0d1cb820218a8999bbfbd292a51269cff84c6ea7e21",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1466,
        "sourceEnd": 1582,
        "text": "Yes, to some extent. You can turn off some features, like personalized ads. But some basic data is always collected.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "9d18c53acdc410512e9243e7ccafe3ba24720de055a4f9425942fe74594bfb44",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1588,
        "sourceEnd": 1644,
        "text": "I see. So my sister is partly right, but not completely.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "465a5fbf2ee72a0e5a7a89a7c830e3f02adac5b154bdca4859f20bd5d8c5b97b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1650,
        "sourceEnd": 1781,
        "text": "Exactly. It's good to be careful, but you don't need to be afraid of the speaker. Just learn how it works and adjust your settings.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "8fa2efcff238866e91dfde6851a10f8fd0feb55531b917068901a56d9ebf8732",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1787,
        "sourceEnd": 1876,
        "text": "Thanks, Mia. I feel better now. I'll talk to my sister and show her the privacy settings.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "65d46661efe56f59625bd7107c2131dafb69ed52960165f6842288617dab8dfa",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "mia",
        "speaker": "Mia",
        "sourceStart": 1882,
        "sourceEnd": 1990,
        "text": "That's a good idea. And remember, if you have any doubts, you can always contact the company's support team.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "a7a6a55c98d77117cc4486ea2f73b1fbc36c967b6b55cf5719bd9631e2918760",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "ben",
        "speaker": "Ben",
        "sourceStart": 1996,
        "sourceEnd": 2017,
        "text": "I will. Thanks again!",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "7ec0f3bd879ce79d673ab6f5bf15ffea5cf3cfab4558a0d328431e435ecff9d3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
